### GET ALL WEAPONS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weapons

### GET ONE WEAPON
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weapons/3

### GET HELLO FOR USER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weapons/hello/user

### GET HELLO FOR ADMIN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weapons/hello/admin

### GET HELLO FOR UNKNOWN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weapons/hello/unknown

### CREATE ONE WEAPON
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weapons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Browning",
  "category": "Gun"
}

### UPDATE ONE WEAPON
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weapons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "3",
  "name": "Browning",
  "category": "Machine gun"
}

### DELETE ONE WEAPON
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/weapons/3
###
